        "original_id": "7e1e9283-2bbf-54db-aaf9-8aa099129688",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide\n- People: Jim Jones\n- Organizations: Nailbomb, Peoples Temple\n- Events: Dynamo Open Air Festival, Jonestown\n- Places: Guyana\n- Topics: industrial metal, album artwork\n\nFacts:\n- Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide is a 1995 album by the industrial metal band Nailbomb.\n- Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide captures Nailbomb's only live appearance at the 1995 Dynamo Open Air Festival.\n- The artwork for Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide shows the aftermath of Jonestown.\n- Jonestown was a remote settlement in northwestern Guyana established by the Peoples Temple.\n- Peoples Temple was an American socialist organization led by Jim Jones.",
