        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Proud to Commit Commercial Suicide\n- Places: Jonestown\n- Organizations: Peoples Temple\n- People: Jim Jones\n- Topics: Jonestown suicides\n\nFacts:\n- Jonestown was the informal name of the Peoples Temple Agricultural Project, a remote settlement in northwestern Guyana.\n- The Peoples Temple Agricultural Project was established by the Peoples Temple, an American socialist organization led by Jim Jones.\n- Jonestown became infamous for the Jonestown suicides.\n- The album cover of Proud to Commit Commercial Suicide depicts the aftermath of the Jonestown suicides.",
